{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2023-05-24 16:15:00', 'title': 'AMD TO PARTICIPATE IN BANK OF AMERICA GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., MAY 24, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TODAY, AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) ANNOUNCED THAT DAN MCNAMARA, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER, SERVER BUSINESS, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BANK OF AMERICA GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, JUNE 6, 2023 AT 2:20 PM EDT/11:20 AM PDT.'}